    "updated_at": "2017-06-01T09:44:34Z",
    "body": "The spec seems clear and sane. If Gecko gets away with following it, hopefully the rest could start doing it too. Also note that in Blink, color -> border-color propagation is stopped if border-style is inset (and probably with the other 90's 3D style values as well). This weirdness isn't limited to HR.",
