    "body": "Ah, ok.\r\n\r\nIsn't the `gray` color too dark, though? The border in Chromium is \\#9a9a9a on the top and \\#eeeeee on the bottom; same as specifying `border: 1px inset #eee`.\r\n\r\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/5225",
